I am Darienne, a 15th level neutral Wizard, following Thoth...
At one point, Thoth was happy enough with me to grant me a
couple of special weapons, but it seems like whenever I
stop sacrificing creatures for more than one floor, he
becomes "offended" by me again... I'm not attacking any
friendly creatures, and in fact in some cases haven't been
doing anything at all, yet a typical experience goes like
this:

	I sacrifice something on the alter and it is accepted...
	In some cases, I've gotten a reward in return...
	then next time I'm weak with hunger, I get
	"you find that Thoth is offended" ...
	and I don't get food... then I have to go find an
	altar somewhere and sacrifice two or three times
	before he's "mollified" ....

What am I doing to so irritate him??  I've had the same
experience with every character I've run (of all alignments)
since I learned about altars...



